Trained detector weights
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The trained per-kitchen detectors are published separately on Hugging Face and fetched by
scripts/download_weights.py:
    ArashNasr/ai2thor-kitchen-perception-floorplan1
    ArashNasr/ai2thor-kitchen-perception-floorplan15
    ArashNasr/ai2thor-kitchen-perception-floorplan17
They are derived from Ultralytics YOLO and trained on frames rendered in AI2-THOR; see each model card for terms.
